{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39826","headline":"江南秋日 · 殷文圭","name":"江南秋日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水国由来称道情，野人经此顿神清。\n一篷秋雨睡初起，半砚冷云吟未成。\n青笠渔儿筒钓没，蒨衣菱女画桡轻。\n冰绡写上江南景，寄与金銮马长卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}